{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791780960, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T04:56:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T04:57:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791781020, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:56:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 62144, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "鼠患問題真的很嚴重，不僅僅是公園附近充斥著老鼠在穿梭，現在都進到我們住家大樓裡，很擔心咬斷電線及健康", "display_name": "中山代表 No.62,144", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:56:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 62145, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "市政", "content": "行人垃圾桶太少，去夜市或走在路上都不知道垃圾要丟哪裡！雖然怕丟家用垃圾，但不應該懲罰市民的權益", "display_name": "信義代表 No.62,145", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:56:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 62146, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "我是機車族，每天在基隆路上通勤，但路上公車很多再加上路邊可能有很多臨停導致機車族的路權被壓縮", "display_name": "信義代表 No.62,146", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T04:56:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 62147, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "請協調解開聖人瀑布的捆龍鎖，開放觀光(限制瀑布下方不要進入就好)，讓內外雙溪的水質恢復往昔的清澈乾淨", "display_name": "士林代表 jasonccp", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 62145, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.62,145", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 62146, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.62,146", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 62147, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 jasonccp", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 50022, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.50,022", "district": "shilin", "is_rep